  "translation": {
    "title": "Seguro médico (contratación por internet)",
    "description": "Contrate un seguro médico para estudiantes por internet y obtenga la póliza al instante para la solicitud de residencia.",
    "content": "<!-- Health Insurance — NEW HEADER STYLE -->\n<section id=\"pkg-insurance\"\n  style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;color:#111;line-height:1.6;margin-top:28px;\">\n\n  <style>\n    #pkg-insurance{\n      --fas-blue:#143591;\n      --fas-red:#ED1C24;\n      --fas-muted:#475569;\n      --fas-border:#e7eaf3;\n      --fas-soft:#f8fafc;\n      --fas-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(2,6,23,.06);\n      --fas-radius:18px;\n    }\n    #pkg-insurance .container{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 14px}\n\n    /* HERO (new title style) */\n    #pkg-insurance .hero{\n      background:\n        radial-gradient(900px 260px at 15% 0%,rgba(20,53,145,.12),transparent 55%),\n        radial-gradient(900px 260px at 85% 0%,rgba(237,28,36,.10),transparent 55%),\n        #fff;\n      border:1px solid var(--fas-border);\n      border-radius:calc(var(--fas-radius) + 6px);\n      box-shadow:var(--fas-shadow);\n      padding:18px;\n      margin-bottom:14px;\n    }\n    #pkg-insurance .kicker{\n      display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\n      font-size:12px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.12em;\n      text-transform:uppercase;\n      color:var(--fas-blue);\n      background:rgba(20,53,145,.08);\n      border:1px solid rgba(20,53,145,.16);\n      padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;\n    }\n    #pkg-insurance h2{\n      margin:10px 0 6px;\n      font-size:28px;\n      font-weight:950;\n      color:var(--fas-blue);\n      letter-spacing:-.02em;\n    }\n    #pkg-insurance .lead{\n      font-size:15.5px;\n      color:var(--fas-muted);\n      max-width:95ch;\n      margin:0;\n    }\n\n    /* CONTENT */\n    #pkg-insurance .grid{\n      display:grid;\n      grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;\n      gap:14px;\n      align-items:stretch;\n    }\n    #pkg-insurance .card{\n      background:#fff;\n      border:1px solid var(--fas-border);\n      border-radius:16px;\n      padding:14px 16px;\n      box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(2,6,23,.05);\n    }\n    #pkg-insurance ul{margin:8px 0 0 18px;line-height:1.75}\n    #pkg-insurance .muted{color:var(--fas-muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:10px}\n\n    /* CTA */\n    #pkg-insurance .cta{\n      display:flex;\n      align-items:flex-start;\n      justify-content:space-between;\n      gap:14px;\n      background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--fas-blue) 0%,#102b7f 100%);\n      border-radius:16px;\n      padding:16px;\n      color:#fff;\n      box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(20,53,145,.18);\n      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);\n    }\n    #pkg-insurance .cta .ttl{font-weight:950;font-size:18px;margin:0 0 6px}\n    #pkg-insurance .cta .sub{margin:0;color:rgba(255,255,255,.92);font-size:14px;line-height:1.55}\n    #pkg-insurance .cta .badge{\n      display:inline-block;\n      margin-top:10px;\n      background:rgba(255,255,255,.14);\n      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);\n      padding:6px 10px;\n      border-radius:999px;\n      font-size:12px;\n      font-weight:900;\n      letter-spacing:.02em;\n    }\n    #pkg-insurance .cta .btn{\n      display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;\n      background:#fff;color:var(--fas-blue) !important;text-decoration:none !important;\n      padding:12px 16px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:900;font-size:14px;\n      box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.18);\n      white-space:nowrap;\n      transition:transform .08s ease, box-shadow .2s ease, opacity .2s ease;\n    }\n    #pkg-insurance .cta .btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.22);opacity:.98}\n\n    /* NOTE */\n    #pkg-insurance .note{\n      border-left:4px solid var(--fas-red);\n      background:var(--fas-soft);\n      border-radius:12px;\n      padding:12px 14px;\n      margin-top:12px;\n    }\n    #pkg-insurance .chip{\n      display:inline-block;\n      background:var(--fas-red);\n      color:#fff;\n      font-size:12px;\n      font-weight:900;\n      padding:4px 10px;\n      border-radius:999px;\n      margin-right:6px;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 900px){\n      #pkg-insurance .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}\n      #pkg-insurance .cta{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch}\n      #pkg-insurance .cta .btn{width:100%}\n    }\n  </style>\n\n  <div class=\"container\">\n\n    <!-- HERO -->\n    <div class=\"hero\">\n      <span class=\"kicker\">SERVICIOS ESENCIALES PARA ESTUDIANTES</span>\n      <h2>Seguro médico (contratación por internet)</h2>\n      <p class=\"lead\">\n        Los estudiantes pueden contratar una póliza <strong>por internet con tarjeta</strong>; la póliza en PDF está\n        <strong>inmediatamente</strong> disponible para las solicitudes de residencia.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- CONTENT -->\n    <div class=\"grid\">\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:var(--fas-blue);font-size:18px;font-weight:900;\">Por qué es importante</h3>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Planes adaptados a estudiantes; póliza disponible en inglés y turco</li>\n          <li>Válido para citas de residencia y matrículas universitarias</li>\n          <li>Pago rápido y envío inmediato por correo electrónico</li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <div class=\"note\">\n          <span class=\"chip\">Nota</span>\n          Ajuste la <strong>fecha de inicio de la póliza</strong> al calendario de la solicitud de residencia o del permiso.\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"cta\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Buy Health Insurance Online\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"ttl\">Contrate por internet y obtenga el PDF al instante</div>\n          <p class=\"sub\">\n            Pago seguro con tarjeta a través de Find And Study. Descargue el archivo de su póliza justo después de la compra.\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"badge\">Pago rápido • PDF inmediato • Preparado para la solicitud de residencia</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <a class=\"btn\"\n           href=\"https://www.findandstudy.com/service/health-insurance-eng/\"\n           target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\n           aria-label=\"Buy Health Insurance Online\">\n          🛡️ Contratar seguro\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"muted\">\n      Consejo para agentes: si el estudiante prevé solicitar la residencia inmediatamente después de su llegada, ajuste la fecha de inicio de la póliza para evitar periodos sin cobertura.\n    </p>\n\n  </div>\n</section>"
  }
}